Subject: [PATCH 1/2] lakeside diag: one-time [QF_LAKE_DIAG] print at the board
 light apply, gated by cc/env DEBUG && ?lakediag=1

Scene design asked whether tone mapping applies. Prints once: isHDR / toneMappingType (pipelineSceneData, postSettings), pipeline,
camera usePostProcess / exposure (render camera) / aperture / shutter / iso, main light illuminance, ambient skyIllum, plus the
list of fields that came back undefined; failures console.error. DEBUG is false in release builds, so it never runs or prints
there; in debug it needs ?lakediag=1. Test lakeside-diag (gate truth table, gate before print, one call site, errors logged).

Standalone on r3 f3d3614 (supersedes a47c8fe, same content).
